            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A high-voltage DC relay convenient for quick assembly includes a housing (1), and load leading-out terminals (2), coil leading-out terminals (3) and auxiliary leading-out terminals (4) being provided with a connecting part (21, 31, 41) for electrical connection with an external component. The connecting parts (21, 31, 41) are respectively exposed to the housing (1); The connecting part (21) of the load leading-out terminal (2) is arranged at a top end of the housing (1); and the connecting parts (31, 41) of the coil leading-out terminal (3) and the auxiliary leading-out terminal (4) is arranged at a bottom end of the housing (1). Each connecting part has a welding plane (211, 311, 411) for electrical connection with a corresponding one of the external components through quick welding. The present disclosure has characteristics of simple structure, low manufacturing cost and reliable electrical connection.</p>
            </abstract>
